!! ACTION REQUIRED BEFORE FIRST PUBLIC PUSH !!

This file must contain the complete, verbatim text of the GNU Affero General
Public License version 3. It is ~35 KB of legal text and it must be exact —
an approximation is worse than no licence at all, because it is unenforceable
while appearing to be enforceable.

Fetch it and replace this file entirely:

    curl -fsSL https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.txt -o LICENSE

Then verify the first line reads:

    GNU AFFERO GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE

and the file is approximately 34,500 bytes. Delete this notice.

Until that is done, this project has NO valid open-source licence and must not
be published.
